    "body_normalized": "**System Information**\nOperating system: Windows-10-10.0.19045-SP0 64 Bits\nGraphics card: NVIDIA GeForce MX450/PCIe/SSE2 NVIDIA Corporation 4.6.0 NVIDIA 536.99 Opengl Backend\n\n**Blender Version**\nBroken: version: 5.2.0 Alpha, branch: main, commit date: 2026-05-28 22:54, hash: `4dd539286811`\nWorked: N/A as the affected node is new in 5.2\n\n**Short description of error**\nIn [NOD_geo_closure_to_list.hh](https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/src/branch/main/source/blender/nodes/geometry/include/NOD_geo_closure_to_list.hh#L94), the output identifiers are currently prefixed with `Grid_`.\nLooks like a copy/paste mistake.\n\n**Exact steps for others to reproduce the error**\n1. Add geometry node\n2. Add Closure to List node\n3. Add output\n4. run `bpy.data.node_groups[\"Geometry Nodes\"].nodes[\"Closure to List\"].outputs[0].identifier` in console\n```Python\n>>> bpy.data.node_groups[\"Geometry Nodes\"].nodes[\"Closure to List\"].outputs[0].identifier\n'Grid_0'\n```",
    "body_raw": "**System Information**\nOperating system: Windows-10-10.0.19045-SP0 64 Bits\nGraphics card: NVIDIA GeForce MX450/PCIe/SSE2 NVIDIA Corporation 4.6.0 NVIDIA 536.99 Opengl Backend\n\n**Blender Version**\nBroken: version: 5.2.0 Alpha, branch: main, commit date: 2026-05-28 22:54, hash: `4dd539286811`\nWorked: N/A as the affected node is new in 5.2\n\n**Short description of error**\nIn [NOD_geo_closure_to_list.hh](https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/src/branch/main/source/blender/nodes/geometry/include/NOD_geo_closure_to_list.hh#L94), the output identifiers are currently prefixed with `Grid_`.\nLooks like a copy/paste mistake.\n\n**Exact steps for others to reproduce the error**\n1. Add geometry node\n2. Add Closure to List node\n3. Add output\n4. run `bpy.data.node_groups[\"Geometry Nodes\"].nodes[\"Closure to List\"].outputs[0].identifier` in console\n```Python\n>>> bpy.data.node_groups[\"Geometry Nodes\"].nodes[\"Closure to List\"].outputs[0].identifier\n'Grid_0'\n```\n\n\n",
